which it has,

00:05:10.777 --> 00:05:13.379
but not nearly as abundant
as its rare earths.

00:05:13.379 --> 00:05:15.748
If you've only heard about
one rare earth mine

00:05:15.748 --> 00:05:17.817
in the United States, it's
almost certainly this one

00:05:17.850 --> 00:05:19.819
in and out of the news
every decade for the past

00:05:19.819 --> 00:05:22.422
50 years,
an incredible ongoing saga

00:05:22.455 --> 00:05:24.357
go to any other rare earth
mine in the world.

00:05:24.357 --> 00:05:26.059
None of them will give you
as much in rare earths

00:05:26.059 --> 00:05:28.094
per bucket pulled out of
the ground in Mountain Pass.

00:05:28.161 --> 00:05:29.595
Take one scoop
out of this mine

00:05:29.595 --> 00:05:30.863
