for a critical material.

00:22:10.495 --> 00:22:11.263
It was plausible.

00:22:11.263 --> 00:22:12.264
Felt like a clean trade.

00:22:12.264 --> 00:22:14.132
Both parties win some,
both parties lose some.

00:22:14.132 --> 00:22:15.867
Everyone aware
that, yes, China

00:22:15.901 --> 00:22:17.636
could deliver some pain
if they wanted to.

00:22:17.669 --> 00:22:20.372
But the first rule of being
a monopoly is

00:22:20.372 --> 00:22:21.773
you do not talk about

00:22:21.773 --> 00:22:23.075
