00:22:26.411 --> 00:22:27.679
De beers monopoly.

00:22:27.713 --> 00:22:29.081
Luxottica,
the company that makes

00:22:29.081 --> 00:22:30.615
95% of all glasses.

00:22:30.615 --> 00:22:33.352
Sun and regular monopoly
ASML, the company

00:22:33.352 --> 00:22:35.320
that makes the machines
that make semiconductors

00:22:35.320 --> 00:22:36.722
monopoly Bloomberg

00:22:36.722 --> 00:22:38.757
terminal all monopolies
which okay,

00:22:38.757 --> 00:22:40.092
everyone
is not overjoyed about,

00:22:40.092 --> 00:22:41.893
but we're all relatively
fine with because

00:22:41.893 --> 00:22:44.496
none of these companies
have ever crossed the line.

00:22:44.563 --> 00:22:46.898
The line that signals
the game has shifted from,

00:22:46.932 --> 00:22:47.699
we're just trying to make

00:22:47.699 --> 00:22:49.067
