00:22:52.904 --> 00:22:53.672
We have.

00:22:53.672 --> 00:22:55.407
The line
China crossed on April

00:22:55.407 --> 00:22:56.908
4th, 2025.

00:22:57.142 --> 00:22:58.243
Yes, actually,

00:22:58.243 --> 00:22:59.511
all those people
in the Pentagon

00:22:59.511 --> 00:23:00.312
